SAFETY NOTICE

This project controls a powered, rideable vehicle. The "AS IS" and warranty
disclaimers above are not boilerplate here: the control software is
experimental, has never been validated against hardware, and is published as
an engineering record rather than as something fit to ride. Anyone building on
it is responsible for their own safety analysis and their own hardware
interlocks.
